from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib,datetime
N=Path('/Users/jonreilly/Documents/Codex/research_runs/toe_leap_20261009/renewal_20261014_214309');A=N/'single_port_program_research';R=N/'single_port_program_decisive_check';D=N/'single_port_program_root_review';D.mkdir(exist_ok=False)
def pin(p):
 b=p.read_bytes();return {'path':str(p),'bytes':len(b),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()}
def check(p,r):assert all(pin(p)[k]==r[k] for k in ('bytes','sha256')),str(p)
def read(p):return json.loads(p.read_text())
freezes=[]
for p,k,h in [(A/'FINAL_FREEZE.json','members','15d6ad5e756548ddd1437624513b0d3b43060ba99a735b8a2ea9036449f7ba4c'),(R/'FINAL_FREEZE.json','files','381d34ec60e13c02100283f751ac3ca3b26b21842af1a11b6ea474e86e7a0829')]:
 assert pin(p)['sha256']==h
 for row in read(p)[k]:
  q=Path(row['path']);check(q if q.is_absolute() else p.parent/q,row)
 freezes.append({'freeze':pin(p),'verified_members':len(read(p)[k])})
m=read(R/'SOURCE_MANIFEST.json')
for x in m['sources']:
 for k in ('original','captured'):check(Path(x[k]['path']),x[k])
for x in m['local_sources']:check(Path(x['path']),x)
receipts=[]
for phase in ('capture','verification'):
 p=R/'metadata_runs'/phase/'EXECUTION.json';x=read(p);assert x['exit_code']==0 and x['failure'] is None and x['scientific_execution'] is False
 for k in ('child_source_at_launch','recorder_at_launch','launch','stdout','stderr'):check(Path(x[k]['path']),x[k])
 for r in read(Path(x['launch']['path']))['inputs']:
  for k in ('original','captured'):check(Path(r[k]['path']),r[k])
 receipts.append(pin(p))
text='''# Root acceptance and current qualifications: external one-port compiler

The exact source bda0be88 and complete decisive review3ad0ab65 support a conditional full-space endpoint/window theorem for a supplied weak positive NN Heisenberg path and one externally driven boundary X/Y port. Root read the full source and author report, then the full separate review and current metadata helpers/receipts. The source is accepted only with the following current qualifications; its frozen historical bytes remain unchanged. This is neither retained audit nor a native-control result.

The pure-path induction uses double commutators. For the kth boundary bond of Jbar, after subtracting known prefix terms, T_X=-2(YY+ZZ), T_Y=-2(XX+ZZ), T_Z=-2(XX+YY). Their linear combinations isolate XX,YY,ZZ; local rotations, new-site commutators and the prefix adjoint ideal generate full su(2^(k+1)). The single commutator is i(YZ-ZY), not the isotropic bond. This corrects the original intermediate wording without assuming single-excitation dynamics or importing a citation's unverified hypothesis.

The nonzero highest coefficient of the Lie-word determinant proves arbitrarily weak rational successful lambda choices; it does not prove that every weak lambda works. Complete computable matrix data, target determinant lift and numerical certificates are supplied. Compact positive-time semigroup closure and the zero-second-coordinate ideal give the augmented SU(d) x T_H density needed for the actual elapsed T. Dovetailed strict rational search terminates existentially, without a computed instance, prescribed finite time bound or efficiency claim. Same-duration C1 smoothing preserves T and accounts for its physical scalar area. For 0<=s<=w the target is exp(-isH) W exp(-iTH), with the stated actual coherent phase and operator error epsilon_c+lambda b_J w. The weak path remains in the generator throughout compilation; lambda T is not assumed small.

Nonempty fixed inventory is required by the displayed min/max box and b_J formulas. Every box filler, old factor and passive reference is retained with arbitrary input. Identity on fillers means no extra disturbance relative to the complete target, not unchanged old-filler correlations under a nontrivial old transformation. Pure-memory reset requires supplied independent pure E on which H acts trivially up to retained scalars, or an explicit adequate aged-state premise. Biased-memory consequences likewise apply to the actual aged input. All displaced records remain outputs.

The reserve r>=h+zeta_peak certifies positivity of the whole actual generator. It does not certify that every separately specified old/faulty local channel is a positive block. A consumer requiring literal positive blocks must supply an explicit local decomposition and sufficient allocated scalar reserves, with their phases/action retained. Choosing additional local reserves is possible when complete local terms and bounds are supplied, but this is an explicit changed reserve ledger, not a consequence of h>=norm(H) alone. The new path and positive port terms have their stated positive blocks.

Calibration work does not require derivative bounds in every admissible contract. For regular closed dynamics with same initial state, nominal B=H+rI+lambda J, zero endpoint C, and actual defect D, the exact endpoint identity gives |W_actual-W_nominal| <= [h+lambda(L-1)] min(2,2 E_cal) + norm(D(T)) + norm(D(0)). Endpoint-defect bounds therefore suffice; variation/derivative control is an alternative when estimating work termwise. Keep the scalar oscillation witness with unbounded derivative but zero net work, and the terminal scalar-spike witness with vanishing integrated norm but unbounded endpoint work. Integrated unitary error alone supplies neither endpoint work nor peak positivity. Nominal work, static action, all waits, isolation, slew, timing and finite window costs remain explicit.

The review is source exposed, same model/effort, with shared prior context. Both complete arguments were read and exact metadata identities checked, but no scientific computation, pulse search, matrix instance, simulation or formal proof was run. The author's limited paper reading/retrieval history remains attributed; root and reviewer do not claim a fresh paper reading or novelty. No axiom, editable prompt, audit verdict or science repository was changed by this source decision.

The autonomous interface18 remains open in this source alone. A separate currently reviewed NN clock/mediator candidate may supply it only after its own proof and exact consumer hypotheses are checked. Native prepared controller and memory supply, physical energy/work identification, finite detector/readout, common caps, efficient synthesis and restoration/reuse remain unresolved.
'''
(D/'ACCEPTANCE.md').write_text(text)
x={'utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'decision':'Conditional external one-port endpoint/window source accepted with mandatory corrected Pauli step, endpoint-or-variation work contract and whole-generator positivity scope.','acceptance':pin(D/'ACCEPTANCE.md'),'source':pin(A/'DERIVATION.md'),'review':pin(R/'REPORT.md'),'freezes':freezes,'actual_metadata_receipts':receipts,'root_full_read':True,'scientific_programs_run':0,'historical_programs_replayed':0,'retained_audit':False,'editable_prompt_files_changed':[]}
(D/'VERIFICATION.json').write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\n');(D/'FINAL_FREEZE.json').write_text(json.dumps({'utc':x['utc'],'files':[pin(p) for p in sorted(D.iterdir()) if p.is_file()]},indent=2)+'\n');print(json.dumps({'acceptance':pin(D/'ACCEPTANCE.md'),'freeze':pin(D/'FINAL_FREEZE.json'),'verified_members':[r['verified_members'] for r in freezes]}))
